---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: EnvironmentalAllocation[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for substantiateClaims. Compare proposed narrative claims with actual measured outcomes and activity evidence. Separate completion of an initiative from demonstrated environmental benefit, qualify estimated results, and reject persuasive claims unsupported by the reporting data. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
